<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">2 Yohans</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohans</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Yohans Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt">Wosheetso Yohans Gitl Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohans woshts wosh gitltso b́ guut'e wosheets eenasho Yohansn wotat b́ guut'ewwere marat'ets máágenunat bnana'uwotsshe. Etoonwere at'biyi ikutsi Ik' mowunat bitsi ash ashuwotsnsh woto k'ayaatse, dan k'awunan b́ guut'e boatsatsewo boshunetwok'o boosh gawiyona, kootets daniruwotsatsnat bodaniyatse boatso korbodek'etuwok'owee.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Shuno jamoniyere dambe 4-6</para>
  <para style="io1">Kootets daniyrwots danatse ats kotiy jango 7-11</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ jamo 12-13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Tiyoke eenashoke, marat'ets moogenunat b nana'otsnsh, Tí s'uzi b́woteftsere ar dants jamwotswere iti shunfne. <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>Aranwere no dagotse fa'onat shino maantsisho dúre dúron noonton beetwoniye.<verse eid="2JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Ik'o nihonat b́ naay Iyesus Krstotsoke s'aatona, mihretiyona, jenonwere, aronat shunon noonton wotowe.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aronat shuni jangon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>N nana'uwotsitse ik ikuwotsi niho noon bí azaztsok'on arikeewon kup'at boere t datstsotse ayidek'at gene'owere. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/>Moo genee, andoor oona neesha, neesh t guut'irwan tzazi handr ark'aye, and t guut'irwan «No ats atsewo shunewone» etts shintson dek't nowooke teshts tzaziyoniye. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Ari shuna eto Ik' tzaziyo fina etee. Tzaziymanwere shintson it shishtsok'on «Shunon beewere,» ettsoniye.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Iyesus ash wotat meetson b́ be'etsok'o amanerawwots ash sheeliyru aywots datsanatse tuurne. Mank'o ashaan ant'elcirwonat Krstosi k'efirwoniye. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Itmó it k'awntso s'eenon dek'osh kup'ore, it fintso b́ t'afrawok'o korde'ere.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Krstos danits danaats s'ap'de'er beerawo bíatsnowere wokar ametuwonton Ik'o aaliye, Krstos danits danaats s'ap'de beet ashontonmó Nihonat Nayon bíntoniye bofa'oni. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Dan han b́deshawo konwor itok b́wetitkawotiyal it meyits kindshk'ayere, dab́ jamonor bín aatk'ayere. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Bín jam aatit asho bínton gond fino kaytsoni b́wotiti.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamó</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Itsh guut'osh t geyirwo ay keewo detsfe, wotowa eree jamo dabdayon wosho geeratse, Maniyere itok borr noonon itn keewiye tgeyiriye, manwere noshunewo s'een b́ wotituwok'o geeyatniye. <verse eid="2JN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>N mish marat'etsu nana'uwots neesh jamo woshernee.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
